# The GitHub Action reads action/channel.json from the default branch. It
# selects the releases that each user of the action installs. The program
# owner reviews each change to the action code, the channel, the oldest
# supported vet, the issue form and the workflows. The action code holds
# the cooldown and the signer rules. The review of the workflows keeps a
# v2 release workflow off the v1 branch.
